From 3b3f693ae7c4423e8e6afc04ed12dd59cd76f3c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jayesh Rathod <jayesh4.rathod@ril.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 13:08:11 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 03/14] Label non-equity instruments observe-only and reconcile
 open positions

Finding
-------
Hull Pine has been paper-trading ETFs. 13 of the 16 positions in
pine_hull_state.json are index funds, and 3 of the 5 currently open are:
GSEC10IETF (a government-securities ETF, TRAILING), MOMENTUM50 and ABSLNN50ET.
Only BERGEPAINT and FOSECOIND are equities. pine_hull/engine.py joins no
security master, so any symbol with 300 bars was a candidate. On 2026-08-20,
343 symbols in the price feed that traded that session are absent from the EQ
master, and every one inspected was an ETF or index fund.

Decision
--------
Rather than reject them, the gateway now classifies them. A symbol absent from
the EQ security master is admitted and displayed as NON_EQ_UNVERIFIED with
data_verified=False, and is entry_blocked: it may be observed but cannot
receive a paper entry, because its series, market cap, delivery and promoter
data cannot be trusted. Labelling is not a loophole -- freshness, lifecycle and
regulatory rules still apply to it, which is asserted.

require_universe_membership=True restores hard rejection with
NOT_IN_CURRENT_NSE_UNIVERSE for callers that want it.

Added v2/universe_reconciliation.py
-----------------------------------
The gateway decides what may be entered; this decides what happens to a
position already open in a symbol that may no longer be traded.

  CORPORATE_CONVERSION  merged with a known successor and ratio. Converted, not
                        exited: realised P&L is zero and the position continues
                        in the successor. Fractional entitlements are recorded
                        rather than silently rounded (175 JBCHEPHARM -> 89
                        TORNTPHARM plus 0.25 for the scheme to settle).
  TERMINAL_EXIT         terminal with no successor. Closed at last price and
                        flagged for manual review.
  UNIVERSE_EXIT         still trades but is no longer enterable: stale,
                        restricted, or an observe-only non-equity holding.
                        Closed at the last close so paper P&L stays continuous.

Accepts plain mappings, so it serves the JSON state files used by Hull Pine and
the Momentum Ladder as well as V3's sqlite portfolio store.

Tests: 12 new for reconciliation, 3 new for instrument classification, 54 pass
across the gateway and V3 wiring suites.
